udvm-f: x / y and x % y, for x from 0 to 999 and y from 1 to 999.
Cells 61-98. To call it, put y in cell 79, load x into the accumulator and JMP 61.
It returns the quotient x / y in the accumulator and the remainder x % y in cell 78.
It overwrites its own cells and cell 99; y in cell 79 is kept.
Size 38 cells. It runs at most 275 instructions, 30.3 on average, counted from cell 61 to the return jump in cell 98.
Exact over the domain.

